# SA:MP's own models and animations (sampcov.pwn commands, one per line; `sleep|S` waits, `shot|NAME` takes a
# screenshot): objects, a pickup and an attached object with models 18631..19999 from SAMP.img / SAMP.ide, and an
# animation of the "SAMP" library (SAMP.ifp inside SAMP.img). Run after the spawn by samp-rs-ab.sh (CMDS=...) on the
# DLL client and by mod-join.sh (CMDS=...) on the samp mod, which needs SA:MP's data files in its folder.
